1
00:00:02,466 --> 00:00:03,900
I'm the one who called it in

2
00:00:04,500 --> 00:00:05,633
Cynthia knows nothing about it

3
00:00:05,900 --> 00:00:06,600
Whatever anger you have

4
00:00:06,833 --> 00:00:07,733
take it out on me

5
00:00:11,333 --> 00:00:13,200
I didn't come here to argue today

6
00:00:13,700 --> 00:00:15,333
Withdraw the report right now

7
00:00:15,500 --> 00:00:16,800
Get Daniel out

8
00:00:17,033 --> 00:00:18,233
No way

9
00:00:19,066 --> 00:00:19,833
You

10
00:00:21,933 --> 00:00:23,600
If you don't get Daniel out

11
00:00:24,066 --> 00:00:26,033
I'll shout here with a megaphone every day

12
00:00:26,233 --> 00:00:28,066
Tell everyone how you mistreat your in-laws

13
00:00:28,066 --> 00:00:29,500
I'll ruin your business

14
00:00:29,900 --> 00:00:32,000
Let's see who dares to buy your forest frogs

15
00:00:32,100 --> 00:00:33,133
If you dare to do that

16
00:00:33,133 --> 00:00:34,066
I'll call the police

17
00:00:34,200 --> 00:00:36,100
Your whole family stole trade secrets

18
00:00:36,266 --> 00:00:37,133
That's a much more serious crime

19
00:00:37,133 --> 00:00:38,566
than what Daniel is facing now

20
00:00:39,200 --> 00:00:40,033
When the time comes

21
00:00:40,033 --> 00:00:41,466
you two will end up in jail as well

22
00:00:41,900 --> 00:00:44,300
Cynthia, never mind that he's heartless

23
00:00:44,800 --> 00:00:46,033
Daniel is your own brother

24
00:00:46,266 --> 00:00:48,133
You're just going to watch him go to jail

25
00:00:49,266 --> 00:00:50,900
He should pay for his mistakes

26
00:00:51,033 --> 00:00:51,433
Besides

27
00:00:51,433 --> 00:00:52,433
when he did those things

28
00:00:52,433 --> 00:00:53,233
he never treated me like a sister

29
00:00:53,466 --> 00:00:54,300
You ungrateful brat

30
00:00:54,900 --> 00:00:56,133
You heartless thing

31
00:00:56,266 --> 00:00:58,400
Go ahead and scream. All my life

32
00:00:58,433 --> 00:00:59,466
whenever Daniel got in trouble

33
00:00:59,466 --> 00:01:00,700
I was the one who got blamed

34
00:01:01,333 --> 00:01:02,300
I'm used to it

35
00:01:04,933 --> 00:01:05,833
If you don't leave

36
00:01:05,866 --> 00:01:06,800
I really will call the police

37
00:01:06,833 --> 00:01:08,666
and send your whole family to jail for a reunion

38
00:01:10,433 --> 00:01:11,466
You just wait
